        "id": "joH-VDSG16jn"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Task\n",
        "\n",
        "- Create a 3x3 matrix A of random integers between 0 and 9.\n",
        "- Transpose the matrix A and keep the result in B.\n",
        "- Replace all values of B below the mean with 0 and keep the result in C.\n",
        "- Multiply this C matrix with the original A matrix.\n",
        "\n",
        "Tip: Read the documentation for np.random.randint and np.where"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Solution"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 52,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "MrCDRrGaVbA-"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "[[52 10 16]\n",
            " [ 0 49 28]\n",
            " [16 32 32]]\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "a = np.random.randint(0, 10, (3, 3))\n",
        "b = a.T\n",
        "c = np.where(b < np.mean(b), 0, b)\n",
        "result = c @ a\n",
        "\n",
        "print(result)"
      ]
    }
